For a generated formal theorem with statement $\widehat T$ and a complete shadow
set $\mathcal{S}=\{S_1,\ldots,S_n\}$, define
\[
\text{\ourmetric}(\widehat T,\mathcal{S}) =
\begin{cases}
1,
& \begin{array}{l}
\text{if } \widehat T \text{ compiles, } \\
\widehat T \Rightarrow S_i \text{ for all } i, \\
\text{and } \bigwedge_{i=1}^n S_i \Rightarrow \widehat T;
\end{array}\\
0, & \text{otherwise.}
\end{cases}
\]
